<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Future Opportunity Hub | Certificates, Study Abroad & Competitions</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#081a2b;
color:#f7f2e7;
line-height:1.6;
}

.container{
max-width:1200px;
margin:40px auto;
padding:30px;
}

/* =========================
HERO
========================= */

.hero{
background:
linear-gradient(135deg,#183b59,#0b1d2e);
padding:70px 45px;
border-radius:28px;
text-align:center;
margin-bottom:55px;
box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

.hero h1{
font-size:3.2rem;
line-height:1.15;
margin-bottom:22px;
}

.hero h1 span{
color:#f2cb88;
}

.hero p{
max-width:780px;
margin:auto;
font-size:1.12rem;
line-height:1.9;
color:#e3d9c6;
}

/* =========================
PATH INDICATOR
========================= */

.path-strip{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:15px;
margin-top:40px;
}

.path-item{
padding:18px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
border-radius:16px;
}

.path-item strong{
display:block;
color:#f2cb88;
font-size:1.05rem;
margin-bottom:4px;
}

.path-item span{
font-size:.9rem;
color:#c9c0b2;
}

/* =========================
SECTION HEADINGS
========================= */

.section-title{
text-align:center;
font-size:2.35rem;
margin-bottom:14px;
}

.subtitle{
text-align:center;
max-width:750px;
margin:0 auto 42px;
color:#d7cab6;
}

/* =========================
MAIN OPPORTUNITY CARDS
========================= */

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:25px;
}

.card{
background:#122c44;
padding:32px;
border-radius:22px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
transition:.3s;
min-height:330px;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-7px);
background:#163650;
box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
}

.icon{
font-size:2.7rem;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.card h3{
font-size:1.45rem;
margin-bottom:13px;
color:#f2cb88;
}

.card p{
color:#d7cab6;
line-height:1.75;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.card ul{
padding-left:20px;
color:#cfc5b5;
}

.card li{
margin-bottom:8px;
}

/* =========================
DECISION SECTION
========================= */

.decision{
margin:65px 0;
}

.decision-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:20px;
}

.decision-card{
background:#0f2438;
padding:27px;
border-radius:20px;
border-left:4px solid #f2cb88;
}

.decision-card h3{
color:#f2cb88;
margin-bottom:12px;
}

.decision-card p{
color:#d7cab6;
}

/* =========================
VALUE SECTION
========================= */

.highlight{
margin:60px 0;
background:#173654;
padding:45px;
border-radius:27px;
text-align:center;
}

.highlight h2{
font-size:2.15rem;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.highlight > p{
max-width:760px;
margin:auto;
color:#d7cab6;
}

.value-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
gap:18px;
margin-top:35px;
}

.value-box{
background:#0d2235;
padding:25px 18px;
border-radius:18px;
}

.value-box h3{
color:#f2cb88;
font-size:1.8rem;
margin-bottom:8px;
}

.value-box p{
color:#cfc5b5;
font-size:.95rem;
}

/* =========================
STRATEGY SECTION
========================= */

.strategy{
margin:65px 0;
}

.strategy-box{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;
gap:22px;
align-items:start;
background:#10283e;
padding:28px;
border-radius:20px;
margin-bottom:15px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
}

.number{
width:55px;
height:55px;
border-radius:50%;
background:#f2cb88;
color:#0b1d2e;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-size:1.25rem;
font-weight:bold;
}

.strategy-box h3{
color:#f2cb88;
margin-bottom:7px;
}

.strategy-box p{
color:#d7cab6;
}

/* =========================
FINAL SECTION
========================= */

.footer-box{
margin-top:60px;
padding:55px 40px;
background:
linear-gradient(135deg,#132f47,#0b1d2e);
border-radius:27px;
text-align:center;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

.footer-box h2{
margin-bottom:18px;
font-size:2.2rem;
}

.footer-box p{
max-width:720px;
margin:auto;
color:#d7cab6;
}

/* =========================
RESPONSIVE
========================= */

@media(max-width:900px){

.grid,
.decision-grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.value-grid{
grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
}

.path-strip{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

}

@media(max-width:600px){

.container{
padding:18px;
margin:20px auto;
}

.hero{
padding:45px 25px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:2.25rem;
}

.value-grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.strategy-box{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.number{
margin-bottom:5px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<!-- =========================
HERO
========================= -->

<section class="hero">

<h1>
Build Proof of What <span>You Can Do</span>
</h1>

<p>
Your education does not have to end with a classroom or a degree.
Certificates can demonstrate specialized skills, studying abroad can expand
your academic and cultural experience, and competitions can give you a way
to prove your ability through real challenges.
</p>

<div class="path-strip">

<div class="path-item">
<strong>📜 Certificates</strong>
<span>Build recognizable skills</span>
</div>

<div class="path-item">
<strong>🌎 Study Abroad</strong>
<span>Learn beyond your usual environment</span>
</div>

<div class="path-item">
<strong>🏆 Competitions</strong>
<span>Test your abilities through challenges</span>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- =========================
THREE PATHS
========================= -->

<h2 class="section-title">Three Ways to Build Opportunity</h2>

<p class="subtitle">
Each path develops a different type of evidence. Choose based on what you
want to learn, experience, demonstrate, or add to your future applications.
</p>

<div class="grid">

<!-- CERTIFICATES -->

<div class="card">

<div class="icon">📜</div>

<h3>Certificates</h3>

<p>
Use structured learning to develop specific knowledge or technical skills
that can strengthen your education, career profile, or portfolio.
</p>

<ul>
<li>Technology & software</li>
<li>Business & management</li>
<li>Data & analytics</li>
<li>Marketing & communication</li>
<li>Professional skills</li>
</ul>

</div>

<!-- STUDY ABROAD -->

<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🌎</div>

<h3>Study Abroad</h3>

<p>
Explore education outside your home country and gain experiences that can
expand your academic perspective, cultural knowledge, and independence.
</p>

<ul>
<li>University programs</li>
<li>Student exchanges</li>
<li>Short-term programs</li>
<li>International courses</li>
<li>Research experiences</li>
</ul>

</div>

<!-- COMPETITIONS -->

<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🏆</div>

<h3>Competitions</h3>

<p>
Turn knowledge into demonstrated ability by solving problems, creating
projects, presenting ideas, or competing against other participants.
</p>

<ul>
<li>Business challenges</li>
<li>Hackathons</li>
<li>Case competitions</li>
<li>Writing & research contests</li>
<li>Innovation challenges</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

<!-- =========================
WHICH PATH?
========================= -->

<section class="decision">

<h2 class="section-title">Which Path Fits Your Goal?</h2>

<p class="subtitle">
You do not have to choose only one. Combining different types of opportunities
can create a much stronger body of evidence over time.
</p>

<div class="decision-grid">

<div class="decision-card">

<h3>Need a Specific Skill?</h3>

<p>
Start with a certificate. Choose something connected to a skill you can
actually demonstrate through projects, work, or a portfolio.
</p>

</div>

<div class="decision-card">

<h3>Want a Different Environment?</h3>

<p>
Explore studying abroad. Look beyond traditional semesters and consider
short programs, exchanges, research opportunities, and international courses.
</p>

</div>

<div class="decision-card">

<h3>Want to Prove Yourself?</h3>

<p>
Look at competitions. A completed challenge can provide evidence that you
can apply knowledge rather than simply say that you know something.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- =========================
WHY THESE MATTER
========================= -->

<section class="highlight">

<h2>Build More Than a Résumé</h2>

<p>
The strongest opportunity strategy is not simply collecting credentials.
It is building evidence that shows what you know, what you can do,
how you operate in unfamiliar situations, and what you are capable of producing.
</p>

<div class="value-grid">

<div class="value-box">
<h3>01</h3>
<p>Knowledge you can explain</p>
</div>

<div class="value-box">
<h3>02</h3>
<p>Skills you can demonstrate</p>
</div>

<div class="value-box">
<h3>03</h3>
<p>Experiences you can describe</p>
</div>

<div class="value-box">
<h3>04</h3>
<p>Results you can show</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- =========================
OPPORTUNITY STRATEGY
========================= -->

<section class="strategy">

<h2 class="section-title">Turn Opportunities Into a Strategy</h2>

<p class="subtitle">
Instead of randomly applying to everything, build an opportunity portfolio.
</p>

<div class="strategy-box">

<div class="number">1</div>

<div>

<h3>Choose a Direction</h3>

<p>
Identify an area you want to understand better or a skill you want to develop.
Your opportunities should connect to something meaningful rather than simply
increase the number of items on your résumé.
</p>

</div>

</div>

<div class="strategy-box">

<div class="number">2</div>

<div>

<h3>Build the Skill</h3>

<p>
Use certificates and structured learning to close knowledge gaps. Whenever
possible, choose learning that results in something tangible you can demonstrate.
</p>

</div>

</div>

<div class="strategy-box">

<div class="number">3</div>

<div>

<h3>Apply the Skill</h3>

<p>
Enter competitions, complete projects, solve problems, write, research,
design, build, or present. Application turns passive knowledge into evidence.
</p>

</div>

</div>

<div class="strategy-box">

<div class="number">4</div>

<div>

<h3>Expand Your Environment</h3>

<p>
Use study-abroad experiences and international programs to encounter different
academic systems, cultures, ideas, and professional perspectives.
</p>

</div>

</div>

<div class="strategy-box">

<div class="number">5</div>

<div>

<h3>Document the Evidence</h3>

<p>
Keep your certificates, competition results, projects, presentations,
research, awards, reflections, and international experiences organized.
Your opportunity history can become part of your professional story.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- =========================
FINAL
========================= -->

<section class="footer-box">

<h2>Keep Building Your Opportunity Portfolio</h2>

<p>
One certificate can add a skill. One competition can demonstrate your ability.
One international experience can change your perspective. The goal is not
to collect opportunities—it is to continuously build evidence of what you
can learn, do, and contribute.
</p>

</section>

</div>

</body>
</html>
